    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPremium location, generous space, and a fantastic layout. Situated in one of Cashel's most highly sought-after, mature, and predominantly owner-occupied estates, the property enjoys a quiet, family-friendly atmosphere with immediate access to local primary schools and is just a short, pleasant stroll from the vibrant town centre. The ground floor features a bright living room with an open fireplace and a spacious kitchen/dining area that opens directly onto a private, secure south-west facing rear garden—perfect for enjoying afternoon and evening sunshine. Upstairs, the practical three-bedroom layout provides well-proportioned, comfortable living spaces perfectly suited for a family. While the structurally sound home simply requires a decorative refresh and personal styling, it presents an exceptional opportunity to modernise to your own taste and add immediate value. Complete with dedicated off-street parking and positioned in an unrivaled neighborhood where homes are highly prized, this property is ready for a new owner to put their personal stamp on it."
      },
